This extension adds God of War (2018) modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]GOG[/*]
[*]Epic[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]
[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]Scriptloader mods are recognised by the Scriptloader installer.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "exec".[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "patch" to the "exec" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named one of: "ActivityFeed", "cinematics", "dc", "languages", "sound" or "wad" to the "exec" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file with one of these extensions: ".texpack" or ".lodpack" to the "exec\patch\pc_le" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "lua" and a file with one of these extensions: ".lua" to the "mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a ".sav" file to the "USER_HOME\Saved Games\God of War\USERID_FOLDER" folder.[/*]
[*]Archives with a FOMOD installer (a "fomod" folder with ModuleConfig.xml) are handed to Vortex's built-in FOMOD installer instead.[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[/list]

